==Miscellaneous==
*Added 4 new [[User Rank]] rewards:
**6,100 grants 5 Special [[Catseye]].
**6,200 grants 5 Rare [[Catseye]].
**6,300 grants 5 Super Rare [[Catseye]].
**6,400 grants 5 Uber Rare [[Catseye]].
*Cat Bases can now be upgraded to level 20.
*[[Bad to Worse]], [[Day of Judgement]], [[Techneurosis]], [[The Wormhole Opens (Deadly)|The 2nd Dimension]] and [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent]] stages now have a set schedule.

